allebeorn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nallebeorn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nallebeorn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nallebeorn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nallebeorn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nallebeorn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-15T18:28:09Z","updated_at":"2025-04-15T18:28:09Z","body":"I don't really have an opinion on what the correct solution would be (an error or warning seems reasonable?) but I can confirm the behaviour in the MRP, on 4.4.1-stable and master [e5ccaa79e2].\n\nBut doing the scene change in `_ready` as the warning message in #99724 suggests doesn't work either. On master, it just crashes the game and in 4.4.1 it gives an error:\n\n> Parent node is busy adding/removing children, `remove_child()` can't be called at this time. Consider using `remove_child.call_deferred(child)` instead.\n\nSee also https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/84681, which seems to be about precisely that.\n\n@AThousandShips","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2807113330/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]